{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0724/1083b70061e6e21.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>從官方視頻了解到，As2-W可實現6m/s高速疾馳，並完成高台俯衝穩落動作；具備IP54級防水，可踏水穿流。其自重約25kg，最大負重達180kg，堪稱「強勁負重隨行，完美徒步搭子」。畫面還顯示其搭載預訓練RL模型6.0，暗示其在複雜地形下的運動控制能力或有突破。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0724/36d9ace0a6d78c5.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0724/51428e218eb3543.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0724/a68a939408f0856.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0724/2bc5a76c48ee744.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0724/1083b70061e6e21.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0724/36d9ace0a6d78c5.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0724/51428e218eb3543.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0724/a68a939408f0856.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T02:46:53.430511+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":9,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}